Then D can be broken via template 1914398 into E and F: precursors ["BrBr", "O=[N+]([O-])c1ccc2c(c1)CCC1(CCC1)O2"].

Then F can be broken via template 74054 into G and H: precursors ["O=C(C)c1c(OH)ccc([N+](=O)[O-])c1", "O=C1CCC1"].

